    "title": "Build an Accessible Combobox",
    "description": "Implement a custom autocomplete widget with full keyboard and screen reader support.",
    "estimatedMinutes": 25,
    "problemStatement": "## Accessible Combobox\n\nCreate a custom combobox (autocomplete) that suggests country names. Requirements:\n\n1. An `<input>` with `role=\"combobox\"`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-owns` (pointing to listbox id), `aria-activedescendant`, and a proper `<label>`.\n2. A `<ul role=\"listbox\">` with `<li role=\"option\">` items, initially hidden.\n3. As the user types, filter a predefined list of countries and show matching options.\n4. Arrow Down opens the list (if closed) and highlights the first option; Up/Down moves highlight; Enter selects the option and closes the list.\n5. `aria-activedescendant` must be updated to the currently highlighted option's id.\n6. A live region announces the number of suggestions.\n7. Clicking outside the combobox closes the list.\n8. The input is filled with the selected option's text.\n\nUse vanilla JS. Start with a hardcoded array of countries.",
    "hints": [
        "Use a hidden class to show/hide the listbox.",
        "To handle clicking outside, use a document click listener and check if the click is inside the combobox container.",
        "When the list is open and the user presses Escape, close the list and set `aria-expanded='false'`."
    ],
    "expectedOutput": "A functional combobox that meets the ARIA 1.2 combobox pattern.",
    "solutionCode": "<!-- HTML -->\n<div class=\"combobox-container\">\n  <label for=\"country-input\">Country</label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"country-input\" role=\"combobox\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-owns=\"country-list\" aria-activedescendant=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n  <ul id=\"country-list\" role=\"listbox\" hidden>\n    <!-- options injected by JS -->\n  </ul>\n  <div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sr-only\" id=\"announcer\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  const countries = ['Canada', 'France', 'Germany', 'Italy', 'Japan', 'Spain', 'United Kingdom', 'United States'];\n  const input = document.getElementById('country-input');\n  const listbox = document.getElementById('country-list');\n  const announcer = document.getElementById('announcer');\n  let options = [];\n  let activeIndex = -1;\n\n  function renderOptions(filter = '') {\n    const filtered = filter ? countries.filter(c => c.toLowerCase().startsWith(filter.toLowerCase())) : [];\n    options = filtered;\n    listbox.innerHTML = filtered.map((c, i) => `<li role=\"option\" id=\"option-${i}\">${c}</li>`).join('');\n    if (filtered.length > 0) {\n      listbox.hidden = false;\n      input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');\n    } else {\n      listbox.hidden = true;\n      input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    }\n  }\n\n  input.addEventListener('input', () => {\n    renderOptions(input.value);\n    activeIndex = -1;\n    input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');\n    announcer.textContent = options.length ? `${options.length} suggestions available` : '';\n  });\n\n  input.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'ArrowDown') {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      if (options.length === 0) return;\n      if (listbox.hidden) renderOptions(input.value);\n      activeIndex = (activeIndex + 1) % options.length;\n      setActive();\n    } else if (e.key === 'ArrowUp') {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      if (options.length === 0) return;\n      activeIndex = (activeIndex - 1 + options.length) % options.length;\n      setActive();\n    } else if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      if (activeIndex >= 0 && !listbox.hidden) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        selectOption(activeIndex);\n      }\n    } else if (e.key === 'Escape') {\n      listbox.hidden = true;\n      input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n      activeIndex = -1;\n      input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');\n    }\n  });\n\n  function setActive() {\n    const items = listbox.querySelectorAll('li');\n    items.forEach((li, i) => {\n      li.classList.toggle('active', i === activeIndex);\n    });\n    if (activeIndex >= 0) {\n      input.setAttribute('aria-activedescendant', `option-${activeIndex}`);\n      // ensure the active item is scrolled into view\n      items[activeIndex].scrollIntoView({ block: 'nearest' });\n    }\n  }\n\n  function selectOption(index) {\n    input.value = options[index];\n    listbox.hidden = true;\n    input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n    input.focus();\n    activeIndex = -1;\n    input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');\n    announcer.textContent = `${options[index]} selected`;\n  }\n\n  listbox.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n    e.preventDefault(); // prevent blur on input\n  });\n  listbox.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    if (e.target.tagName === 'LI') {\n      const index = Array.from(listbox.children).indexOf(e.target);\n      selectOption(index);\n    }\n  });\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    if (!e.target.closest('.combobox-container')) {\n      listbox.hidden = true;\n      input.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');\n      activeIndex = -1;\n      input.removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');\n    }\n  });\n</script>"
}